(
    title: "Yars\' Revenge",
    developer: Some("Howard Scott Warshaw"),
    description: Some("The player flies a fly-like Yar freely around the screen, chewing or shooting through the cell barrier that shields the Qotile at the right. Clearing a path lets the Zorlon Cannon fire from the left, but it tracks the Yar\'s own position and its shot must be dodged. A flickering Ion Zone down the middle of the screen blocks incoming fire while the Yar sits in it, at the cost of being unable to shoot back."),
